                <div class="hk"><span class="en">MARKET-CAP TREEMAP — SIZED BY COMPUTE CAPACITY</span><span class="zh">市值图式矩形树图 — 按算力容量定面积</span></div>
                <div class="tm-num" id="tmNums">
                  <span id="tmNum">0</span><span class="unit" id="tmUnit">GW</span><span class="cap" id="tmScopeLabel"></span>
