              <svg id="tmSvg" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" role="img" aria-label="Compute capacity treemap / 算力容量矩形树图"></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-crumbs">
              <button id="tmBack" class="tm-back" type="button" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">←</span><span class="en">WORLD</span><span class="zh">返回全球</span></button>
              <span id="tmCrumb"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="mapnote">
              <span class="en">Tile area is total compute capacity (tracked plus estimated). Color is the dominant project phase by capacity. Hover for the country breakdown; click a country to drill into subnational tiles.</span>
              <span class="zh">矩形面积代表总算力容量（已知加估算）。颜色代表按容量计的主导项目阶段。悬停查看国家拆分；点击国家下钻到国内地区。</span>
            </div>
